# Directional conviction, defined risk, no premium sold. When the tape
# breaks out with volume, buy the 30 delta call spread instead of
# chasing shares: the debit is the whole downside, the width caps the
# upside, and the management percentages read against what you paid.
# The verb is the side: buy takes the debit, write would sell it.

strategy "Breakout Debit Spread"

universe $SPY

when [new_high 63] and [volume_spike 1.5x]
  buy [call_spread delta=30 width=10 dte=45]

close at [profit 100%]
  or [loss 50%]
  or [dte 10]

risk [contracts 1]
